  accTitle: GitHub OAuth Apps are registered in the UI; there is no create API
  accDescr: Agents can list org members and call Cloudflare Access APIs. They cannot POST a GitHub OAuth App. An operator registers it under the GitHub organization Developer settings, then pastes Client ID and secret into Zero Trust.

